      "blocks": {
        "f1": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "I'm tired all the time but my bloodwork is 'fine.' Will this help?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>This is exactly who Sunstone was designed for. When your doctor says everything is 'normal' but you can't get through the afternoon without caffeine, the problem isn't in your blood — it's in your <strong>adrenals</strong>. Sunstone targets adrenal recovery through crystal frequency at your pulse point.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "f2": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How is this different from B12, iron, or energy supplements?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Supplements add nutrients your body may or may not need. Sunstone targets the <strong>adrenal system itself</strong> — the glands that produce your energy hormones. If the glands are depleted, adding more fuel doesn't help. You need to recover the engine first.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "f3": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Will I get jittery or crash?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>No. Sunstone doesn't stimulate — it <strong>restores</strong>. No spike, no crash, no jitters. Energy builds gradually and stays steady. The opposite of caffeine's boom-and-bust.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "f4": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What if it doesn't work?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p><strong>90-day money back guarantee.</strong> Email hello@myolmi.com. Full refund. No forms.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "f5": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How fast will I feel it?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Most women notice the afternoon crash softening within <strong>week 1</strong>. Real energy shift by <strong>week 2–3</strong>. Full adrenal recovery: <strong>6–8 weeks</strong>.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "f6": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can I stack it with Moonstone for sleep?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes — the <strong>Day & Night Duo</strong> is our most popular combination. Sunstone for daytime energy, Moonstone for nighttime sleep. Two bracelets, one complete cycle.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
